# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD CAMPUS ORBIT
## Unified Multi-Role Academic Operations & Smart Campus Management System

### ROLE AND DEVELOPMENT INSTRUCTIONS

Act as a senior full-stack software architect, enterprise application developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, Firebase specialist and cloud security engineer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, modern, scalable, professional and fully functional college management website named **CAMPUS ORBIT**.

The application must be developed as a comprehensive digital campus ecosystem that connects students, faculty, administrators, parents and institutional management through one centralized platform.

This is not a basic college website, static dashboard, landing page or simple CRUD application.

Build a complete enterprise-style academic management system with real authentication, role-based dashboards, database integration, real-time updates, project collaboration, academic management, analytics and mobile responsiveness.

Do not stop after creating the homepage. Implement the complete application.

---

# 1. PROJECT IDENTITY

**Application Name:** Campus Orbit

**Project Title:** Campus Orbit — Unified Multi-Role Academic Operations & Smart Campus Management System.

**Domain:** Education Technology (EdTech), Enterprise College Management, Cloud Computing and Progressive Web Applications.

**Target Audience:**
- College Administrators
- Principal and Dean
- Department Heads
- Faculty and Professors
- Students
- Parents and Guardians

### Project Vision

Campus Orbit is an integrated digital campus operating platform designed to modernize academic administration, student engagement, faculty operations and institutional communication.

It brings all major college activities into one centralized digital environment.

The platform should eliminate disconnected systems, manual attendance registers, paper-based administration, fragmented academic records and inefficient communication.

Its main goal is to create a smart, transparent, collaborative and connected educational ecosystem.

