# 27. REAL-TIME SYNCHRONIZATION

Use Firestore onSnapshot listeners.

Examples:

- Faculty marks attendance and the student dashboard updates.
- Administrator publishes a notice and users receive it.
- Faculty publishes results and students see them.
- Timetable changes appear on affected dashboards.
- Project invitations update collaboration requests.
- Task updates appear in team workspaces.
- Grievance status changes update student records.

Implement optimistic updates only where appropriate, with error handling and rollback.

Provide clear synchronization and network status indicators.

